"Art Willis" <nhplayer@trantor.nospam.com> wrote:

> You do know that you get spellbooks from prayers
> and artifactc from sacrifices, right?  Pray as
> soon as you get a feeling of renconciliation (or
> no message other than "Your sacrifice is consumed
